  (text "Two TEC1-12706 Peltiers in series on J702 (about 6 V / 3 A each). Q703 (IRLZ44N, logic level) switches them with PWM from PB8 (TIM4_CH3)."
    (at 25 144.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 61acb231-d06d-4b4a-a64e-8a0e1f0a1a6c))
  (text "K3 swaps the polarity: relaxed = cool the pocket, energised (TEC_DIR, PB9) = heat. Firmware sets PWM to 0 before it toggles K3."
    (at 25 148.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 322fbdc5-cdb0-4471-ab5f-65e7fad5a827))
  (text "Peltier and K3 run from +12V_SW, so any fault (or the thermostat) switches the Peltiers off. This replaces the BTS7960 module (cheaper, and no 3.3 V logic problem)."
    (at 25 153.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid cdd6b9b6-9574-47a7-bb77-e056f311d9f4))
  (text "Q702 (BC337) switches both 12 V heatsink fans with PWM from PA8. J705 is the always-on 12 V pocket mixing fan."
    (at 25 157.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid aa7b6d5c-80ef-4905-a178-e2602c21e188))
  (text "How it works / what to check: docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 7."
    (at 25 162.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid b84e342f-a6a3-4c8d-a9bc-1a91de34578e)))
